# The security headers of every static file of every game on the kit
# (Cloudflare Workers static assets): a game's public/_headers is a copy of
# this file (scripts/copy-public.js). What a game's Worker answers itself gets
# the same headers from worker/security-headers.json; tests/security-headers.test.js
# keeps the two copies equal. A JSON file cannot hold comments, so the reasons
# live here. One list for every game: a source one game needs is allowed for all
# of them, so each reason says whose it is.
#
# Content-Security-Policy: the pages run only the game's own code: scripts and
# styles only from its files - no inline scripts, styles or style attributes
# (a script may still set element.style; the kit's tests and each game's
# check the files). Images may be data:
# (Bootstrap draws its icons so; the photo avatars of the kit's landing page
# are data:image URLs) and blob: (the landing page opens an uploaded photo at
# a blob: address before it shrinks it). connect-src 'self' covers the room's
# WebSocket. No plugins, no <base>, and no other site may show a game in a
# frame. A new source here is a deliberate decision, written down here.
#
# Referrer-Policy: a link to another site tells it only the game's address,
# never the page: a room's address holds its code. The coffee link sends
# nothing at all (rel="noreferrer"); this covers any link without it.
#
# Permissions-Policy: browser features no game uses (Web Share, the photo
# picker and the screen wake lock - the kit's wake-lock.js, whoami's started
# round - are not among them).
#
# X-Content-Type-Options: a file is what its Content-Type says, never guessed
# from its content.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; font-src 'self'; connect-src 'self'; media-src 'self'; manifest-src 'self'; worker-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
